":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/hioberman/status/1438167176062672904?s=19","original_url":"https://twitter.com/hioberman/status/1438167176062672904?s=19"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Se7Eg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"39cc46f5-0e17-49e2-9602-d4f2486a3953","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"杭になるほどデカいダイヤ合成を実現したらどこか遠くの国に攫われそう","ts":"1631791844.126700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"yamaiyatsu","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U022XK5866Q"]},{"name":"gem","count":1,"users":["U0238G3KV8D"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wcf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a0468174-549c-4502-8922-ace63af9f807","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"(oxygen not included)","ts":"1631774266.125700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oBf8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"db06c746-2205-41e3-83b8-eb71d5b53004","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ダイヤモンドを杭みたいな感じで地下のマグマ層に打ち込む工事を以前やったんですが、工事自体は熱伝導性高すぎてダイヤモンドがすごい熱せられるし、圧力で割れるしで大変でしたが、その後だいぶ長いこと地熱発電に活用できて最高でした","ts":"1631774262.125400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/Gc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"696d4bef-cebf-4d10-92bf-8bb7249a7a92","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ですです、ダイヤモンドは熱伝導性高くてめっちゃ重宝してました","ts":"1631774203.124200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g=1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ac1252a3-bc8a-44e4-bd8d-37a25354a0d5","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"ダイヤモンド自体も半導体なのでGaNの次にはダイヤモンドデバイスが来る…のはいつだろう（来てほしいけど）","ts":"1631758304.123800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MvbhF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8d70cddf-c848-4fca-8ec0-c9898beacf5f","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"ダイヤモンドをヒートシンクにできるほどのサイズはなかなか難しいので、ダイヤ薄膜を作った上でさらにアルミか銅のヒートシンクに接続することが必要でしょうね","ts":"1631758025.122500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4GYu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c922d7ca-a4dc-470c-845f-8e80caabfe4a","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"ダイヤのCVDは800度とか必要なのでデバイスに影響与えず成膜できるかというとまだやることはたくさんあるでしょうね","ts":"1631757787.119800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a4FuW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f1431e13-de61-4c08-87ab-66d1846d6e77","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"半導体に付けるような薄膜だと、部材として調達できるのかな? CVDとかでその場で作るんちゃうんかね?","ts":"1631757623.118200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]},{"name":"desune","count":2,"users":["UAZ33BKV2","UGHD6GP16"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n1U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9718d744-3794-49cc-a71f-e6ed99e70b72","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ダイヤモンドってそういえば熱をよく通すんだったな","ts":"1631757555.117100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nro93"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7e1723ba-2658-4af8-b845-f496fec807d3","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"ただここ数年でかなり合成ダイヤ市場が広がったので値下がりはしているはず","ts":"1631757538.116500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yAjI0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6c5bea18-2bc2-4dcf-968e-5f52da607648","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"いやあダイヤモンドまだまだお高いですね","ts":"1631757486.115000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nrCkm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"768164a8-243a-41c9-9485-9f2968d8bfde","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"薄くて小さいから、言うてそう高くもないと思うよ。1986にはこんな論文もでてたみたいだし。\n\u003chttps://www.jstage.jst.go.jp/article/sfj1970/33/10/33_10_396/_pdf\u003e","ts":"1631745655.114400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oNf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c407c364-47e9-4522-9d07-d0c7602f910c","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"GaNの先は+ダイヤモンドなのか。おたかそう……。\n\u003chttps://eetimes.itmedia.co.jp/ee/articles/2109/14/news031.html\u003e","ts":"1631720411.112500","attachments":[{"fallback":"EE Times Japan: 大阪市立大学ら、GaNとダイヤモンドを直接接合","id":1,"title":"大阪市立大学ら、GaNとダイヤモンドを直接接合","title_link":"https://eetimes.itmedia.co.jp/ee/articles/2109/14/news031.html","text":"大阪市立大学と東北大学、佐賀大学および、アダマンド並木精密宝石らの研究グループは、窒化ガリウム（GaN）とダイヤモンドの直接接合に初めて成功した。GaNトランジスタで発生する温度上昇を、従来の約4分の1に抑えることができ、システムの小型化や軽量化につながるという。","thumb_url":"https://image.itmedia.co.jp/ee/articles/2109/14/tm_210914tohoku01.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"EE Times Japan","service_icon":"https://eetimes.itmedia.co.jp/favicon.ico","thumb_width":290,"thumb_height":160,"from_url":"https://eetimes.itmedia.co.jp/ee/articles/2109/14/news031.html","original_url":"https://eetimes.itmedia.co.jp/ee/articles/2109/14/news031.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xw2"}]}]
